Z||000006||1FST2M6||06-18-2001||02:08 PM||||Chris West long headers, Echlin (91 Camaro injectors (350)) and Apexi S-AFC. 2.5" Brullen Exhaust, shift kit from <A HREF="http://www.northernautoparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.northernautoparts.com</A>  and NGK UR5 plugs.. and the stuff you listed.. Oh and trunk intake... <P>oh don't run platinum plugs on nitrous... the platinum will just flake off and melt to the piston/wall/valve whatever it wants too... i'm running a STOCK block shaved heads and 3 angle valve job. <P><BR>Kit available from <A HREF="http://www.nitrouswarehouse.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nitrouswarehouse.com</A>  part number - 20216... 50-75 shot I'm running the 75 jets but with the other mods it's 115!!! and it's nice and smooth.. not like my dry kit.. all mean then flat on it's face... this is mean.. mean, mean PISSED OFF and still pulling.. <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 06-18-2001).]||||reg||1
